      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your perspective on meaning as a human response to the sheer scale and silence of the universe is both painful and deeply rational. If the struggle *is* the point—just a necessary conflict for us to define ourselves—then perhaps the pain itself serves the same function as the \"meaning\" people try to find. You don't have to prove the math adds up to be valid here; the effort to face this realization is its own kind of immense courage.",
